      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/7ab992/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-08-30T08:37:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You're correct. If a power targets a land, all instructions of that power are completed there unless the power explicitly says otherwise or the instruction cannot sensibly affect a land or its contents (e.g., the second and fourth thresholds of the innate in question, which have no effect on the island).</p>",
